pro_course_detail.description:
# Are you struggling with depression or anxiety? 
# Do you suffer from low self-esteem? 
# Would you like to be able to build (or re-build) robust relationships with other people? 
# Or maybe, you are eager to succeed in life, get promoted, give up procrastinating  - and you just need a little empathy as well as encouragement!

I'm here to give you my undividied attention, share advice on stress-relieving techniques and life quality-enhancing strategies (including nutrition, lifestyle, fitness and so on).

At the sessions, we will

* discuss the pain points that you want to tackle;
* hone your soft skills (emotional intelligence, small talk, etc);
* apply proven therapy methods (CBT, IFS, mindfulness, visualization, etc) for treating depression, anxiety, fears & phobias, as well as PTSD;
* boost your confidence and self-image;
* set SMART goals and draw up an action plan to achieve those targets.

